description: "; Test: Closures are not Ord\n; Comparing closures should produce a type error since they don't implement Ord.\n\nfun main() {\n  let f = (x: Int) -> Int => x + 1\n  let g = (x: Int) -> Int => x + 2\n\n  ; Closures are not comparable\n  write f < g\n}\n"
---
ERROR: type `(Int) -> Int` does not satisfy `Ord` class
